WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.401
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.401 --> 00:00:03.870
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:05.338
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.338 --> 00:00:07.774
President Biden spoke
from the Oval Office tonight

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:10.710
in a prime-time address
and asked Congress to approve

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.212
$100 billion in emergency funds.

00:00:13.212 --> 00:00:14.781
Well, good luck with that.

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.484
We can't even get Congress
to approve each other.

00:00:17.484 --> 00:00:19.785
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.785 --> 00:00:23.156
Republican Congressman
Carlos Gimenez said yesterday

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.625
that his office
has received robocalls

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.261
encouraging them to vote
for Ohio Congressman Jim Jordan.

00:00:28.261 --> 00:00:30.696
But then he remembered
he actually saved

00:00:30.696 --> 00:00:32.966
Jordan's number as Scam Likely.

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:35.701
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.701 --> 00:00:37.837
A group of moderate
Republican lawmakers

00:00:37.837 --> 00:00:40.506
are reportedly pushing
to temporarily empower

00:00:40.506 --> 00:00:43.242
acting House Speaker
pro tem Patrick McHenry.

00:00:43.242 --> 00:00:44.710
Oh, you mean this guy?

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.612 line:0%
[ Gavel bangs loudly ]

00:00:45.612 --> 00:00:47.280
The...

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.349
The congressman from Asgard?

00:00:49.349 --> 00:00:50.917
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.917 --> 00:00:52.752
Are we sure the lectern
can handle it?

00:00:52.752 --> 00:00:56.389
He slammed that thing like
they just canceled "Fraser."

00:00:58.391 --> 00:01:00.293
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.428
Come on.
That dude watches "Fraser."

00:01:02.428 --> 00:01:04.164
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.164 --> 00:01:07.133
While leaving court yesterday,
former President Trump said

00:01:07.133 --> 00:01:09.268
that he "probably
won't return this week"

00:01:09.268 --> 00:01:11.170
because of an upcoming
golf tournament

00:01:11.170 --> 00:01:12.805
at his Miami golf club.

00:01:12.805 --> 00:01:14.140
And he doesn't want to miss it

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.608
because it's probably
the last time

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:18.177
it will be considered
his Miami golf club.

00:01:18.177 --> 00:01:20.180
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:21.748
A man in Kenya
was arrested recently

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.749
for allegedly
impersonating a lawyer

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:26.085
and winning dozens of lawsuits.

00:01:26.085 --> 00:01:29.355
"I have the exact opposite
problem," said Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:29.355 --> 00:01:32.558
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.558 --> 00:01:34.427
"Maybe I should
stop pretending!"

00:01:34.427 --> 00:01:36.629
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.629 --> 00:01:40.066
In his upcoming biography,
Utah Senator Mitt Romney

00:01:40.066 --> 00:01:42.568
criticizes former
Texas Governor Rick Perry

00:01:42.568 --> 00:01:45.171
and says,
"Republicans must realize

00:01:45.171 --> 00:01:48.607
that we have to have someone
who can complete a sentence."

00:01:48.607 --> 00:01:50.977
Responded Perry,
"How dare?"

00:01:50.977 --> 00:01:53.279
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.315 --> 00:01:56.916
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.916 --> 00:01:59.285
The drugstore chain
Rite Aid announced yesterday

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:01.721
that it will close
at least 150 stores.

00:02:01.721 --> 00:02:04.523
So the Rite Aid
I was in last week...

00:02:04.523 --> 00:02:06.926
you're telling me
that was open?

00:02:06.926 --> 00:02:10.530
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.165
I should have paid somebody.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:16.269
And finally, a couple recently
got married

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:19.071
during the 10-second pit stop
of a NASCAR race.

00:02:19.071 --> 00:02:20.339
And this is embarrassing.

00:02:20.339 --> 00:02:22.342
The honeymoon was even faster.

00:02:22.342 --> 00:02:26.246
"I swear this never happens!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.647
That was a monologue, everybody!

00:02:27.647 --> 00:02:29.582
We're off to the races!
[ Cheers and applause ]

